  "interpretation": "Corrected real64 closely reproduces MATLAB MF evolution, including the ACE 1 peak time/height and renewed growth near 12 h. Matched-source real32 differs visibly in timing and late evolution. For this case, the large trajectory divergence appears when lowering default real precision; the real64 precipitation correction does not produce a comparable divergence. This is a case-specific inference, not universal scientific equivalence or a tolerance."
